# API design conventions — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

<!-- Loaded only when working with files matching the paths above. Edit globs to match
     this project (e.g. "src/api/**/*", "**/handlers/**", "**/routes/**"). -->

- Validate all inputs at the boundary; never trust client data.
- Use the project's standard response/error shape consistently: {{API_RESPONSE_SHAPE}}.
- Preserve existing public contracts and types; if a signature must change, trace and update all callers.
- Authorize every endpoint; never expose data without an access check.
- Document request/response shapes where the project does (e.g. OpenAPI).
